      "message": "1. I think the list will increase \nwe have to add similar logic as in CL:3227374 \n2. how about we add a new configs\nCONFIG_USBC_CUSTOM_VCONN \nCONFIG_USBC_CUSTOM_SBU\nCONFIG_USBC_CUSTOM_PLOARITY\netc\nand call port specific functions inside it?",
